==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*3 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Professor A.]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns.
**1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns.
**1 [[Otta-smack-u]] spawns.
**Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you aren't bringing units that directly outrange Professor A. or Elder Sloth, the best way is to snipe them by using the Otta-smack-us as "stepping stones" for [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance]]/[[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave]] attackers. Generally, however, anything more than two Otta-smack-us will end up pushing into your ranged units, so try to find a good balance between offense and defense.

